WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.048
Go on.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.135
I thought you'd probably come.

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.429
Eat.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:14.431
Yes?

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:18.435
You're really nice, aren't you?

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.272
Eat!

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.952
It's so good!

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:58.475
I'm so full.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:02.479
-Looks like you're done.
-Yes.

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:04.981
Here's your dessert.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:08.985
I'll eat anything.

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:11.988
Here.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.700
What is that?

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:22.749
This is...

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.292
Water.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:25.835
What?

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:26.878
It's ten liters.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:30.340
It's the minimum amount
of hydration you need.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:33.009
You want me to drink ten liters?

00:01:33.718 --> 00:01:35.470
Not in your condition.

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:37.305
FRUCTOSE

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:38.473
Mix this in.

00:01:39.641 --> 00:01:43.645
Fructose is a pure sweetener
refined from fruits.

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:45.814
It's about four kilos.

00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:51.069
It's a lot, but its absorption
is second to none.

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:58.034
Your poison was neutralized
and you recovered.

00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:02.038
But your recovery is not complete.

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:05.500
Hey, that's dirty.

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:09.504
Usually, protein and starch is ideal,

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:12.173
but there's no time.

00:02:20.723 --> 00:02:22.183
Fourteen kilograms

00:02:23.059 --> 00:02:24.352
of sugar water.

00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:26.563
A miracle will happen.

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:35.780
Inflicted by deadly poison,

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:38.741
the boy's body was weakened
to its utmost limits.

00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:44.706
It was further burdened
by the fights that followed.

00:02:45.957 --> 00:02:48.376
The liver, which is the body's storehouse,

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.379
also reached the last of its glycogen.

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:57.760
More and more abuse came from his fights,

00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:02.765
and his muscle cells
were completely destroyed.

00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:05.476
Those cells

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:08.438
swore to get revenge.

00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:14.611
Their revenge on future abuse...

00:03:16.487 --> 00:03:17.614
In the future,

00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:22.160
if the same situation arises...

00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:24.078
Amazing.

00:03:24.162 --> 00:03:26.748
...they will surely
overcome it on their own.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:32.962
A non-human body bestowed by God.

00:03:34.255 --> 00:03:37.634
With this oath to God,
failure is not a possibility.

00:03:42.764 --> 00:03:48.478
The boy's body is now undergoing
unprecedented super recovery.

